      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aArboreal Genesis / Aquatic Simulation / Artificial Greenhouse / Directed Mob Cloning§r\n\nHark to the whispers of all creation......\nYet, save the bees, for they do buzz too loudly.\nThe thaumaturges' latest masterpiece in the Integration of Magic and Electrical Engineering\nReproduce selected environmental and biological processes from simple materials\nFeatures a unique method of overclocking\nEach protocol has a fixed base cycle time\nHigher input power increases recipe parallelism nonlinearly\nInstall an execution protocol in the controller to select the simulation\nOperating media enter through input hatches; fluid-habitat protocols reproduce them in the chamber\nRequires one Eco-Sphere Input Interface and one Eco-Sphere Upgrade Interface\nThis multiblock can only output to ME output buses/hatches\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Input Bus, Input Hatch, Output Bus, Output Hatch, Energy Hatch\n[note]Structure[/note]: Tiered glass (limits the energy hatch tier); Mytryl Frame Boxes; Astral Silver Frame Boxes; the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Thaumcraft Infusion\nResearch: Sphere Simulator (Thaumonomicon, TST tab).\n - item Eldritch Object\n - 2x Ichorium Superdense Plate\n - 4x Circuit UV\n - 4x Robot Arm UV\n - 4x Conveyor Module UV",
